    "Cost": 2874886,
    "UIName": "Whitworth",
    "Id": "chassisdef_whitworth_WTH-GSR-EC",
    "Name": "Whitworth",
    "Details": "A far cry from the most popular of the Gunslinger refits, the <i>Whitworth</i> was still held in high enough regard to eventually recieve the upgrades. Thankfully, the long delay allowed it to skip the awkward early prototypes of larger Streak SRM launchers, and be refitted with some of the first models of the perfected designs. The rest of the 'Mech remained largely unchanged, with the Chameleon Light Polarization System still intact despite the exodus.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.12</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
